# Ivora, Insatiable Heir: "Whenever you discard a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Ivora" - one trigger per card (CR 701.9a)
# and only for the cards its controller discards. Bot1's Wheel of Fortune (turn 3) has Bot1 discard its 3 remaining
# cards and Bot2 its 7: Ivora gets 3 counters, not 10. It is then a 4/4 trampler; Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) blocks it, 2
# damage is assigned to the blocker and 2 tramples over to Bot2 (CR 702.19b), and "deals combat damage to a player"
# makes a second Blood token (the first came as it entered).

